  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_WAYS
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>DOUBLE WAY AWARDS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_WAYS
    value: "<size=22>- Game pays from Left to Right & from Right to Left (5 of a Kind
      only pays once). \n- Only highest win is paid for each winning way.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_02_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>FULL WILD RE-SPIN</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_1
    value: "<size=24>- If                  appears as a full-stack, the Full Wild
      Re-spin is triggered during both\n   Base Games and Free Games.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_2
    value: "<size=24>   - Once initial win is evaluated, triggering                 stack
      is locked and then re-spin\n      the rest of the reels.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_3
    value: <size=24>   - Full Wild Re-spin can be re-triggered during the Full Wild
      Re-spin.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_02_2
    value: <style=title><size=32>TWO TIGERS FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_2_1
    value: <size=24>- During Free Games, the Two Tigers Feature is randomly triggered.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_2_2
    value: "<size=24>- When Two Tigers Feature is triggered, all symbols on reels
      2 and 4 transform into \n            \n                .</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_02_3
    value: <style=title><size=32>BONUS DROP FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_3_1
    value: "<size=22>- During Base Games,                   symbols on at least 4
      different reels triggers the Bonus\n   Drop Feature.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_3_2
    value: "<size=22>- When Bonus Drop Feature is triggered, all reels including triggering
      \                  are locked\n   and one re-spin proceeds with an overlay reel
      composed of                  and blank symbols\n   only. </size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_3_3
    value: <size=22>- The Bonus Drop Feature cannot be re-triggered during the Bonus
      Drop Feature.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_3_4
    value: "<size=22>-                  wins are evaluated first and then the newly
      added                  from the Bonus\n   Drop Feature disappears from the reels.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_3_5
    value: <size=22>- If there are more wins afterwards, then evaluate those wins.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_3_6
    value: "<size=22>- During Free Games,                turns to                and
      \                symbols on at least 4 different\n   reels triggers the Bonus
      Drop Feature as in Base Games.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_03
    value: <style=title><size=32>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_1
    value: <size=22>- 5                   symbols anywhere on all 5 reels triggers
      8 Free Games per combination.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_2
    value: "<size=22>- If user triggers Free Games with 2 or more Bonus win combinations,
      then award 4\n  different Free Games options to choose from.\n- Each option
      awards different amounts of Free Games and All Pay Multipliers.\n- The maximum
      number of initial Free Games is 96. \n- If more than 96 initial Free Games are
      awarded, equivalent Free Games options are\n  awarded.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_3
    value: "<size=22>- e.g. When 192 initial Free Games are awarded, one of the Free
      Games options will be\n  96 Free Games with 2x All Pay Multiplier.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_4
    value: <size=22>-                   turns to                   during Free Games.</size>
